I tried this game from a friend, but they only had alpha version 11. I bought the steam version after seeing all that they've added over the years, and I'm so glad i did. I've already put in 21 hours in 3 days over the weekend. This game is the perfect mix of a survival/story telling sim.
if you're thinking about getting this game,
do it.

